                ("h2", "How we check it"),
                ("p", "First we take the car for a drive to hear and feel what you've described. Then, on the lift, we look for play in every joint, oil leaks from shock absorbers, split rubbers and damaged steering gaiters. From that we give you a written estimate with each part listed separately and tell you what's urgent."),
                ("p", "After replacing parts that affect the geometry, the [[alineacion|wheel alignment]] must be adjusted. Otherwise a new tyre will wear just as badly as the old one. On cars with [[adas|ADAS]] (lane-keeping camera, automatic emergency braking), a calibration may be needed afterwards; we assess this case by case and explain it beforehand."),
