                ("p", "Engine or DPF warning light on, loss of power (the car goes into limp mode), black or white smoke, a strong exhaust smell, hesitation or fuel consumption rising for no reason. Any of these is worth an [electronic diagnosis](servicio-diagnosis-electronica.html) before the problem gets worse."),
